cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GridBERT in your research, please cite this software."

title: "GridBERT: Domain-Adaptive Pretraining for Electric-Grid Reliability Classification"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Baker"
    given-names: "Peter C."
    affiliation: "George Mason University"

version: "0.3"

license: "Apache-2.0"

abstract: >
  GridBERT is a domain-adapted BERT model designed for
  U.S. electric-grid technical, regulatory, planning,
  and reliability text. This repository documents the
  domain-adaptive pretraining, reliability classification,
  evaluation, and statistical analysis of GridBERT v0.3.

keywords:
  - BERT
  - Natural Language Processing
  - Electric Grid
  - Reliability Classification
  - Domain-Adaptive Pretraining
  - Computational Social Science